---
title: Old Fashioned
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, whiskey]
source: Our own
---

In a #mixing cup{}(with ice), pour @bourbon{2%fl_oz} and add @superfine sugar{5%g} along with @Angostura bitters{2-3%dashes}. Stir well, and strain into a #rocks glass{}(well chilled, with ice). Garnish with an @orange{1%slice} and a @cocktail cherry{1}(Luxardo).
